cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This repository is a collection. Cite the specific experiment you use
  from its own CITATION.cff under experiments/<name>/.
title: "Montana Research Foundation Open Data"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility data for the Montana Research Foundation preprints: one
  directory per experiment under experiments/, each with per-rollout
  aggregate records and a self-contained verification script. Task
  families, raw agent transcripts, and held-out grading data are withheld
  under contamination control.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Ricardo
    family-names: Arcifa
    affiliation: Montana Research Foundation
  - given-names: Francieli
    family-names: Carra
    affiliation: Montana Research Foundation
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://montanaresearch.org"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Montana-Research-Foundation/open-data"
keywords:
  - reproducibility
  - language-model evaluation
